{"title":"Meteorite","sourceTitle":"Meteorite/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Meteorite\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Meteorite (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Meteorite/pl\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Meteoryty (27% translated)\" lang=\"pl\" dir=\"ltr\">polski</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Meteorite/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Метеорит (27% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Meteorite/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"陨石 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geração_Natural\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geração Natural</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Recursos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recursos</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Curiosidades\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Curiosidades</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n \n<p><span id=\"Natural&#95;Generation\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span id=\"Gera.C3.A7.C3.A3o_Natural\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geração_Natural\">Geração Natural</span></h2>\n<p><b>Meteoritos</b> são encontrados perto da superfície, <a href=\"/Suevite\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Suevite\">rocha de impacto de suevito</a> ou <a href=\"/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Meteoric iron\">pedaço de ferro meteórico</a> são evidências da presença de um meteorito abaixo.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Meteorite_crater.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Meteorite_crater.png/300px-Meteorite_crater.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"159\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/c/c0/Meteorite_crater.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"212\" /></a><figcaption>A antiga cratera de impacto permanece, no centro está um meteorito.</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Crater_excavated.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/dc/Crater_excavated.png/300px-Crater_excavated.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"159\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/d/dc/Crater_excavated.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"212\" /></a><figcaption>Cratera de impacto escavada revelando ferro meteorítico e pedra de impacto de suevita.</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><b>Dica:</b>\n<pre>Meteorites create very specifically shaped craters. If you learn to identify which holes have meteors you can get a nice source of iron!\n</pre>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Meteorite_crater.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/c0/Meteorite_crater.png/300px-Meteorite_crater.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"159\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/c/c0/Meteorite_crater.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"212\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Old impact crater remains, at the center lies a meteorite.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Crater_excavated.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/dc/Crater_excavated.png/300px-Crater_excavated.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"159\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/d/dc/Crater_excavated.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"212\" /></a><figcaption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Impact crater excavated revealing meteoritic iron and suevite impact stone.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><span id=\"Resources\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recursos\">Recursos</span></h2>\n<p>Os meteoritos de ferro contêm alguns blocos de ferro meteoríticos logo abaixo da camada do solo. Este bloco precisa de um <a href=\"/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\">picareta de ferro</a> para ser extraído e rende de 3 a 5 <a href=\"/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Meteoric iron\">pedaço de ferro meteóricos</a>. Dois de cada dão um <a href=\"/Ingots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ingots\">lingote de ferro</a> e até 12 peças podem ser fundidas em um único <a href=\"/Bloomery\" title=\"Bloomery\">floração</a>. O ferro meteórico se transforma diretamente em lingotes de ferro, ao contrário das pepitas de ferro.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>Iron meteorites contain a few meteoritic iron blocks right below the soil layer. This block needs an <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pickaxe\">iron pickaxe</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe\" title=\"Pickaxe\"> </a></span> to be mined and yields 3 to 5 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meteoric iron\">iron meteorite piece</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Meteoric iron\"> </a></span>s. Two of each gives one <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingots\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingots\">iron ingot</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ingots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ingots\"> </a></span> and up to 12 pieces can be smelted in a single <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bloomery\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bloomery\">bloomery</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bloomery\" title=\"Bloomery\"> </a></span>. The meteoric iron turns directly into iron ingots, unlike iron nuggets.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Blocos de rocha de impacto Suevita têm uma pequena chance de derrubar um diamante bruto.\n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"Trivia\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Curiosidades\">Curiosidades</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Na vida real, a suevita é formada dentro e ao redor das crateras a partir de detritos sinterizados de impacto.</li>\n<li>Na vida real, o ferro meteórico era usado para fabricar ferramentas de ferro antes que os humanos inventassem técnicas para extrair ferro dos minérios.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>In real life, suevite is formed in and around craters from sintered impact debris.</li>\n<li>In real life, meteoric iron was used to make iron tools before humans had invented techniques to extract iron from ores.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Version_history\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Version history\">Versões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Version_history\" title=\"Version history\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Controls\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Controls\">Controles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Controls\" title=\"Controls\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Sistemas de jogo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Spec